            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF140 enables <code class=\"notranslate\">dom.closewatcher.enabled</code> in Nightly for desktop only (not android) in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1966459\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1966459</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note that Android is behind  <code class=\"notranslate\">dom.closewatcher.enabled</code> which is set false.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the associated features.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Docs work done in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3128779131\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39862\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/39862/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39862\">mdn/content#39862</a></p>",
